== extra days on the charity's invoice
tier: everyday
sphere: learn
ladder: known
at: employer
rate: 0.5
share: .004
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 23-75
calls: WRG
holds: consultant
tone: trouble
life: work, money
horizon: week
roles: boss, colleague
earth: your senior partner adds days nobody worked to the bill of a small charity client that never checks its bills
times: Some consultants, once in their working years; padded bills are a known trouble of firms that charge by the day (estimate)
gap: 1-5
scene: Checking the month's bills, {N} finds that {boss} has added four days nobody worked to the invoice of a small charity that helps old people stay in their homes. The charity never queries a bill.
scene W: A bill is a promise of work done. This one is a lie, whoever the client is.
scene U: {N} checks the diary twice: on those days {N} was at another client's office.
scene B: {boss} decides who becomes a partner next year, and {Ns} name is on the list.
scene R: {N} feels sick at the thought of the charity's tiny office paying for days of nothing.
scene G: The charity's director once helped {Ns} own grandmother keep her house.
- W | correct the invoice before it goes, and tell the senior partner why | v: conformity, universalism | lever: voice | sphere: learn.W | chance: 75
- U | pull the time sheets and ask, plainly, where the four days came from | v: universalism | sphere: learn.U | chance: 75
- B | send it as it is, and keep the partners' list in mind | v: security, achievement | mark: hid a wrong | sphere: learn.B | chance: 75
- R | ring the charity and tell them straight that the bill is wrong | v: universalism, self-direction | sphere: learn.R | chance: 75
- G | do four days of real work for the charity for free, so the bill comes true | v: benevolence, tradition | sphere: learn.G | chance: 75
- W>G | take it to the firm's other partners, as the rules say, and shield the charity | v: conformity, benevolence | lever: voice | sphere: learn.W | chance: 65
- U>W | check every charity bill of the past year before saying anything | v: universalism, achievement | sphere: learn.U | chance: 65
- B>U | send it, but keep a copy of the time sheets somewhere safe | v: security | sphere: learn.B | chance: 65
- R>B | tell the senior partner you will report it unless the days come off tonight | act: tell the senior partner they will report it unless the days come off tonight | v: power, self-direction | sphere: learn.R | chance: 65
- G>R | leave the firm and take the charity's work with you, at cost | act: leave the firm and take the charity's work with them, at cost | v: benevolence, self-direction | lever: exit | sphere: learn.G | chance: 65
works: The invoice goes out right, and {boss} never pads a bill on {Ns} desk again.
works: The charity hears what happened and asks for {N} for every piece of work after.
fails: {boss} calls it a typing slip, and {Ns} name drops off the partners' list.
fails: The other partners close ranks, and {N} is moved to a smaller account.

